# HANGTEST=nandpad (docs/kernel/nandboot_hang_analysis.md, hang 24): nandres
# (plain nandboot + hang watchdog + the two no-map areas, no pstore) with
# CONFIG_MV61X0_LAYOUT_PAD sized so that the code and data after fs/pstore/
# and lib/reed_solomon/ sit where they sit in nandps0. Tells whether the
# freeze follows the kernel's layout rather than anything pstore runs.
# DEBUG IMAGE ONLY: it arms a hardware watchdog, so each run needs the
# owner's OK.
CONFIG_CMDLINE="console=ttyS0,115200n8 marvell_nand.write_window=1741,4091 panic=10 consoleblank=0 timer_mv61x0.hang_wdt=30"
CONFIG_MV61X0_LAYOUT_PAD=y
CONFIG_MV61X0_PAD_FS_TEXT=0x36fc
CONFIG_MV61X0_PAD_FS_RODATA=0x594
CONFIG_MV61X0_PAD_FS_RODATA_STR=0xb94
CONFIG_MV61X0_PAD_FS_DATA=0x2f0
CONFIG_MV61X0_PAD_FS_BSS=0x48
CONFIG_MV61X0_PAD_FS_INIT_TEXT=0x1fc
CONFIG_MV61X0_PAD_LIB_TEXT=0x1228
CONFIG_MV61X0_PAD_LIB_RODATA=0x0
CONFIG_MV61X0_PAD_LIB_DATA=0x1c
CONFIG_MV61X0_PAD_LIB_BSS=0x0
